      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Early settlers in Rantoul cultivated the land, drawing on abolitionist networks that even saw John Brown build a house for his brother‑in‑law in 1858.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
